4. Demo video and stills — licensed stills, project-generated clips
-------------------------------------------------------------------
The three demo clips (`media/stand12.mp4`, `taxiway-b.mp4`, `baggage-area.mp4`) are
generated by the project as pan/zoom derivatives of two stills:
- `media/stills/apron-stand.jpg` — Unsplash License (https://unsplash.com/license);
- `media/stills/baggage-hall.jpg` — CC0 (djedj, Pixabay);
  https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/.
No third-party airport video with unknown provenance is part of the current build. The old
unresolved clips were removed from the current tree; they remain in git history. The
`zone-*.jpg` stills are frames from the generated clips, so they are project-generated too.
Screenshots, the GIF and the social preview are project-produced from these generated clips
and stills. Re-check by hand that no unblurred face is visible before publishing.

The Unsplash apron still may show an aircraft livery or airport signage. The Unsplash licence
does not grant trademark rights; clear the airline/airport marks or replace the still before
commercial use.

